      "result": "Implemented the Laravel 11 URL shortener in `/workspace`.\n\nThe API supports link creation, listing, lookup, and redirects with persistent click counts. It validates URLs and codes, returns the required error statuses, and registers the routes at the root paths. `start.sh` is executable, applies migrations, then serves on `0.0.0.0:8000` with `--no-reload`; the README explains startup.\n\nVerification passed: all 5 tests (27 assertions), route listing, and a live MySQL-backed create → redirect → click-count lookup. The temporary live-test link was removed afterward.",
